{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310221001:0":{"text":"ねえねえ、君たち……","source_cn":"嗨，嗨！你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC97FE2A1C8024515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310221002:0":{"text":"ロンロンたちのことですか？","source_cn":"我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC01C9CF7D72BE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310221003:0":{"text":"うん！君たちはハムスターなの？こんなに可愛い種族なんて初めて見たよ！","source_cn":"嗯，就是你们！你们是仓鼠吗？我还从来没见过你们这么可爱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEF07C3DF03D67D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310221004:0":{"text":"でしょでしょ！私もそう思ってたんだあ！","source_cn":"是吧是吧，我也觉得他们特别可爱呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D1EF2F840EDC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310221005:0":{"text":"わっ！王女のお姉ちゃんだ！すっごく綺麗だね！","source_cn":"哇，是公主小姐姐！公主小姐姐好漂亮！<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EBCD315D18367EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310221006:0":{"text":"坊や、お姉ちゃんではなく、「王女様」ですよ。","source_cn":"小朋友，你要称呼她为“公主殿下”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C58DA67F733E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310221007:0":{"text":"あ、そっか……綺麗な王女のお姉ちゃん様！一緒に雪だるまを作ろうよ！","source_cn":"那……公主小姐姐殿下好漂亮哦！你们要不要和我一起堆雪人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3550C5B11DDE504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310221008:0":{"text":"ええいいわ！ロドリゴ、堅苦しいのは嫌だって言ったでしょ？今日はお祭りなのよ！あなたも一緒に作りましょ！","source_cn":"好呀！罗德里戈，都说了放松一点，这可是最好玩的冬日祭典...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x067A39330E5F7700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310221009:0":{"text":"……承知しました、姫様。","source_cn":"……是，公主殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8F05DDD814D6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310221010:0":{"text":"やったあ！みんなで大きくて綺麗な雪だるまを作ろう！","source_cn":"太好了，咱们一起堆几个又大又好看的雪人！<key:di...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC31FC7BA2230880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亚历克斯":{"text":"アレックス","source":"亚历克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロ